    "body": "## SUPERSEDED — EXECUTION SURFACE RETIRED\n\nFresh main `80956a43df9d939b2ce39f806fb67a72d2705ac8` contains the merged #259 fail-closed retirement of the local SALVADOR/ComfyUI production entrypoint. This PR explicitly preserves `PRODUCTION_IMAGE_EDIT` as the legal task kind and builds daemon/reference-bridge lifecycle around that old controller route.\n\nThat execution surface is no longer a current ZORR production path. Keeping this PR open would preserve a competing legacy route contrary to the Constitution one-critical-path law and #251.\n\nDisposition: close unmerged as `SUPERSEDED / HISTORICAL`. Preserve branch and discussion; do not reactivate the retired local production daemon.",
